      '**A lookup file** - an Excel list of the people who may approve this step, imported on the **Lookups** page: one row each, with a column for their **sign-in email address** and any other columns you like (school, name, phone). Choose the file, the **Column with their email** and optionally the **Column with their name** (both are guessed from the headings), and tick any other columns to **show, filled in, beside the chosen person**. Each step can use a different file - for example a list of secretaries for step 1, of principals for step 2 and of payroll managers for step 3.',
      '**Everyone with the Approver role** - the chooser picks from the approvers on the Users page.',
